        -:  171:    /**
        -:  172:     * Check if the boundary of shape (this) lies closer to the point \a aP than \a aClearance,
        -:  173:     * indicating a collision.
        -:  174:     *
        -:  175:     * @param aActual [out] an optional pointer to an int to store the actual distance in the
        -:  176:     *                event of a collision.
        -:  177:     * @param aLocation [out] an option pointer to a point to store a nearby location in the
        -:  178:     *                  event of a collision.
        -:  179:     * @return true, if there is a collision.
